Zero-training side arm: Supa and Titan-OFF with 3-shot scratchpad prompting, as a quick CPU check. The expected result is failure, which would show the gain needs the learned format.

Optional tool arm: the model emits the bit strings, code converts decimal and binary.

Evaluation:
